},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spiritwhoosh","id":45},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_aoe_nmag_h","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":47},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_amiyamag_h","volume":"0.9","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.5","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_defboost","volume":"0.5","Delay":"0.4","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.2","Delay":"0.7","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.2","Delay":"0.7","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_heavy","volume":"0.9","id":53},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.4","b":"0.4","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.4","b":"0.4","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"1","g":"0.4","b":"0.1","afrom":"1","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"0.4","bfrom":"0.4","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"0.8","rfrom":"1","gfrom":"1","bfrom":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"丝线从阿米娅的法杖上散开，试图阻拦普瑞赛斯前进的脚步……","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"但地面上的源石总是能从刁钻的角度生长出来，内化阿米娅的所有法术。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"你能看出来阿米娅很吃力。","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"眼前这个几乎无法抗衡的普瑞赛斯，还有凯尔希唯一留存下来的东西——","id":64},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你想要救它？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":69},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"71","text":"……"}},"values":[],"id":70},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":71,"end":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我也想修好它，和你一样。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"AMa-10不仅承载了我们共同的期待，它还保存了一段对我而言极为关键的记录。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"你依旧没有从刚刚的冲击中缓过来。","id":76},{"type":"text","text":"面对眼前的威胁，你甚至没有悲伤的余力。","id":77},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯，她还会有怎样的行动？你又该如何保护阿米娅……","id":78},{"type":"text","text":"而普瑞赛斯显然注意到了你的心思——","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#6$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你……为什么在害怕我？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"她与你愈发接近。","id":83,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"86","text":"（……想出办法。）"},"2":{"id":"86","text":"（快想出办法！）"}},"values":[],"id":85},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":86,"end":88},{"type":"text","text":"你和阿米娅被脚下蔓延的源石完全限制，无法动弹。","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"你第一次如此近距离地见到了她。","id":88,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"0.5","id":90},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"0.5","id":91},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_bg_bg_graduate.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":98},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"103","text":"你究竟要做什么？！"}},"values":[],"id":102},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":103,"end":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"……保护你。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"就像我承诺过的那样。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"我承诺过，我会保护阿米娅，也会保护你。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"我会保护你至你生命的最后一刻，博士。这是我的职责。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"但我不会停止恨你。我无力教育和批评迷迭香，因为我也害怕自己会忍不住报复你。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"113","text":"……你……"}},"values":[],"id":112},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":113,"end":118},{"type":"text","text":"类似的场景，类似的话语，不同的情感与不同的时代在你记忆的空洞里架起了桥梁。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"……","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"你……想起了什么？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"background","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":126},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_8_9.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"“普瑞赛斯”。","id":129},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"132","text":"……"}},"values":[],"id":131},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":132,"end":133},{"type":"text","text":"不，这一次你先想起了她，想起了凯尔希。","id":133,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"background","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"那位你信任的医生似乎还在这里。","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"你想起了当你的思维在“文明的存续”中搜索凯尔希为你们留下的线索……","id":144},{"type":"text","text":"想起了当所有的关键被串联起来之后，凯尔希为你留下的那句话——","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"“我从未忘记。”","id":146},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"image","id":150}